gHU(){return'Playas does not require registration or sign-in and does not request personal information. We do not track user activity and do not use cookies for user identification.\n\nAccess to location is requested only with the user\u2019s explicit consent and only while the user actively uses the \\"Find nearby beaches\\" feature (foreground use). We do not collect background location data and we do not store a history of user locations. The user may revoke location permission at any time via the device settings.'},
